      "content": "I ran PANDA earlier on our ovarian cancer data and exported the thresholded network as a CSV with columns source, target and weight, where the source is a TF and the target is a gene, and all weights are non-negative. Please run CONDOR on that file to find communities of regulators and genes."
    },
